---
import '../styles/global.css';
---
<html lang="id" class="scroll-smooth">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Jaya Sentosa Group - Layanan Wi-Fi</title>
</head>
<body class="bg-gray-50 text-gray-800 font-sans antialiased">

    <header class="bg-white shadow-sm sticky top-0 z-50 py-4 px-6 md:px-12 flex justify-between items-center">
        <div class="text-2xl font-extrabold text-blue-700">Wifi Jaya Sentosa Group</div>
        <nav class="hidden md:flex gap-6 font-semibold">
            <a href="#keuntungan" class="hover:text-blue-600 transition">Keuntungan</a>
            <a href="#paket" class="hover:text-blue-600 transition">Paket Wi-Fi</a>
            <a href="#aplikasi" class="hover:text-blue-600 transition">Aplikasi Mobile</a>
        </nav>
    </header>

    <section class="bg-gradient-to-br from-blue-800 to-blue-500 text-white py-24 px-6 text-center">
        <h1 class="text-4xl md:text-5xl font-bold mb-6">Internet Cepat, Stabil, Tanpa Batas</h1>
        <p class="text-lg md:text-xl max-w-2xl mx-auto mb-8 text-blue-100">
            Nikmati pengalaman berselancar tanpa hambatan dengan layanan Wi-Fi terbaik dari Jaya Sentosa Group.
        </p>
        <a href="#paket" class="inline-block bg-orange-500 hover:bg-orange-600 text-white font-bold py-3 px-8 rounded-full transition transform hover:scale-105 shadow-lg">
            Lihat Paket Kami
        </a>
    </section>

    <section id="keuntungan" class="max-w-6xl mx-auto py-20 px-6">
        <h2 class="text-3xl font-bold text-center text-blue-800 mb-12">Mengapa Memilih Kami?</h2>
        <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-3 gap-8">
            <div class="bg-white p-8 rounded-2xl shadow-sm hover:shadow-md transition text-center border-t-4 border-blue-500">
                <div class="text-4xl mb-4">🚀</div>
                <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-blue-700 mb-2">Koneksi Ngebut</h3>
                <p class="text-gray-600">Jaringan fiber optik terbaru untuk kecepatan maksimal di setiap ruangan.</p>
            </div>
            <div class="bg-white p-8 rounded-2xl shadow-sm hover:shadow-md transition text-center border-t-4 border-blue-500">
                <div class="text-4xl mb-4">♾️</div>
                <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-blue-700 mb-2">Bebas Kuota (FUP)</h3>
                <p class="text-gray-600">Streaming dan gaming sepuasnya tanpa takut kecepatan diturunkan.</p>
            </div>
            <div class="bg-white p-8 rounded-2xl shadow-sm hover:shadow-md transition text-center border-t-4 border-blue-500">
                <div class="text-4xl mb-4">🛠️</div>
                <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-blue-700 mb-2">Teknisi 24 Jam</h3>
                <p class="text-gray-600">Dukungan penuh kapan pun Anda membutuhkan bantuan jaringan.</p>
            </div>
        </div>
    </section>

    <section id="paket" class="bg-white py-20 px-6">
        <div class="max-w-6xl mx-auto">
            <h2 class="text-3xl font-bold text-center text-blue-800 mb-12">Pilih Paket Sesuai Kebutuhan Anda</h2>
            <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-3 gap-8 items-center">
                
                <div class="bg-gray-50 border border-gray-200 rounded-2xl p-8 text-center hover:shadow-lg transition">
                    <h3 class="text-2xl font-bold text-gray-700 mb-2">Paket Basic</h3>
                    <div class="text-4xl font-extrabold text-blue-600 mb-2">Rp150.000<span class="text-lg text-gray-500 font-normal">/bln</span></div>
                    <p class="text-blue-500 font-bold mb-6">20 Mbps</p>
                    <ul class="text-left space-y-3 mb-8 text-gray-600">
                        <li class="flex items-center">✅ Cocok untuk 2-3 Perangkat</li>
                        <li class="flex items-center">✅ Gratis Pemasangan</li>
                        <li class="flex items-center">✅ Router Standar</li>
                    </ul>
                </div>

                <div class="bg-blue-800 rounded-2xl p-8 text-center shadow-xl transform md:scale-105 relative text-white">
                    <div class="absolute top-0 left-1/2 transform -translate-x-1/2 -translate-y-1/2 bg-orange-500 text-white px-4 py-1 rounded-full text-sm font-bold">
                        PALING LARIS
                    </div>
                    <h3 class="text-2xl font-bold mb-2">Paket Keluarga</h3>
                    <div class="text-4xl font-extrabold text-white mb-2">Rp250.000<span class="text-lg text-blue-200 font-normal">/bln</span></div>
                    <p class="text-orange-400 font-bold mb-6">50 Mbps</p>
                    <ul class="text-left space-y-3 mb-8 text-blue-100">
                        <li class="flex items-center">✅ Cocok untuk 5-8 Perangkat</li>
                        <li class="flex items-center">✅ Gratis Pemasangan</li>
                        <li class="flex items-center">✅ Router Dual-Band Premium</li>
                        <li class="flex items-center">✅ Prioritas Teknisi</li>
                    </ul>
                </div>

                <div class="bg-gray-50 border border-gray-200 rounded-2xl p-8 text-center hover:shadow-lg transition">
                    <h3 class="text-2xl font-bold text-gray-700 mb-2">Paket Ultra</h3>
                    <div class="text-4xl font-extrabold text-blue-600 mb-2">Rp400.000<span class="text-lg text-gray-500 font-normal">/bln</span></div>
                    <p class="text-blue-500 font-bold mb-6">100 Mbps</p>
                    <ul class="text-left space-y-3 mb-8 text-gray-600">
                        <li class="flex items-center">✅ Cocok untuk >10 Perangkat</li>
                        <li class="flex items-center">✅ Gratis Pemasangan</li>
                        <li class="flex items-center">✅ Router Mesh System</li>
                    </ul>
                </div>

            </div>
        </div>
    </section>

    <section id="aplikasi" class="max-w-6xl mx-auto my-20 bg-blue-50 rounded-3xl p-8 md:p-12 flex flex-col md:flex-row items-center gap-12 border border-blue-100 shadow-sm">
        <div class="flex-1">
            <h2 class="text-3xl font-bold text-blue-900 mb-4">Kelola Wi-Fi dalam Satu Genggaman</h2>
            <p class="text-lg text-gray-700 mb-6">
                Pelanggan Jaya Sentosa Group diwajibkan untuk mengunduh aplikasi resmi kami untuk menikmati layanan yang maksimal.
            </p>
            
            <div class="bg-white border-l-4 border-orange-500 p-5 mb-8 rounded-r-xl shadow-sm">
                <p class="font-bold text-orange-600 mb-2">⚠️ PENTING UNTUK PELANGGAN</p>
                <p class="text-gray-600 text-sm leading-relaxed">Melalui aplikasi ini, Anda dapat memantau masa aktif berlangganan dan melakukan pembayaran tagihan dengan mudah dan aman.</p>
            </div>

            <div class="flex flex-wrap gap-4">
                <a href="LINK_PLAYSTORE" class="bg-gray-900 text-white px-6 py-3 rounded-xl font-bold hover:bg-gray-800 transition flex items-center gap-2">
                    <span>📱 Download di link berikut</span>
                </a>
            </div>
        </div>
        
        <div class="flex-1 flex justify-center items-center">
            <div class="relative w-[300px] h-[620px] bg-gray-900 rounded-[2.5rem] p-3 shadow-2xl border-4 border-gray-700">
                <div class="absolute -left-[7px] top-24 w-[4px] h-12 bg-gray-700 rounded-l-md"></div>
                <div class="absolute -left-[7px] top-40 w-[4px] h-12 bg-gray-700 rounded-l-md"></div>
                <div class="absolute -right-[7px] top-32 w-[4px] h-16 bg-gray-700 rounded-r-md"></div>

                <div class="w-full h-full bg-white rounded-[1.25rem] overflow-hidden">
                    <img 
                        src="/public/ss_tampilan_tagihan_mobile_wifi.jpeg" 
                        alt="Screenshot Tampilan Tagihan Aplikasi Wifi Jaya Sentosa Group" 
                        class="w-full h-full object-cover object-top"
                    />
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </section>

    <footer class="bg-gray-900 text-gray-400 py-12 px-6 text-center">
        <div class="max-w-6xl mx-auto">
            <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-white mb-4">Wifi Jaya Sentosa Group</h2>
            <p class="mb-4">Jln. Gombong-Klampok Pala RT 03 RW 06 Jurang - Jero, Desa Sampang, Kec. Sempor, Kab. Kebumen </p>
            <div class="flex justify-center gap-6 mb-8 text-sm">
                <span>Telp: 0851-6586-3800</span>
            </div>
            <div class="border-t border-gray-800 pt-8 text-sm">
                &copy; 2026 Jaya Sentosa Group. Hak Cipta Dilindungi.
            </div>
        </div>
    </footer>

</body>
</html>